Let me add: the scouting with your son piece that you did last time was spot on.

14
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Well, thank you very much, Bill. I certainly appreciate that.

15
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Remember, Bill has Bob White's Blather.

16
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:40,000
It's a blog by Bill who's a very experienced troop committee chairman.

17
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:42,000
I ought to make sure to check that out.

18
